  "readmeFile": "README-Crawler.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.5.0 - Lockstep version bump for stability/maintenance base-package improvements.\n\t\t\tRequires base package [2.5.0]. No crawler API breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.4.0 - Lockstep version bump aligned with tooling/docs/UI modernization cycle.\n\t\t\tRequires base package [2.4.0]. No crawler API breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.3.0 - Version bump to maintain lockstep with base package batch execution release.\n\t\t\tRequires base package [2.3.0]. No crawler API breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.2.1 - Version bump to maintain lockstep with base package. Requires base package [2.2.1].\n\t\t\tAll 27 crawler tests passing (81 runs across net8.0, net9.0, net10.0). Zero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.2.0 - Quality & Tooling: Added Source Link debugging, symbol packages (.snupkg), \n\t\t\ttrimming/AOT readiness with RequiresUnreferencedCode/RequiresDynamicCode annotations, \n\t\t\tpackage baseline validation, explicit ILLink.Tasks 10.0.1 reference. Requires base \n\t\t\tpackage [2.2.0]. All 27 crawler tests passing (81 runs across net8.0, net9.0, net10.0). \n\t\t\tZero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.1.2 - Security patch: Updated to match base package version for lockstep versioning.\n\t\t\tFixed js-yaml and glob vulnerabilities in documentation dependencies. Requires base\n\t\t\tpackage [2.1.2]. Zero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.1.1 - Version bump to maintain lockstep with base package. Requires base package\n\t\t\t[2.1.1]. Zero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.1.0 - Added .NET 10 multi-targeting support. All projects now target net8.0,\n\t\t\tnet9.0, and net10.0. Requires base package [2.1.0]. All 81 crawler tests passing on all\n\t\t\tthree frameworks (243 test runs, 0 failures). Zero breaking changes.",
